{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>荷里活女星珍妮花露柏絲（Jennifer Lopez）前晚出席演唱會電影《THE JLO SHOW: Live in Las Vegas》於美國洛杉磯派拉蒙片場舉行的首映禮，她以白色透視長裙配白色花花圖案外袍上陣大騷性感。</p><p>珍妮花更嫌透視裝唔夠性感，行紅地氈期間拉開外袍大騷其超強巨胸，令人看得血脈沸騰！除了服裝搶眼之外，她亦行頭十足，鑽石頸鏈中間位置的黃鑽石足足100卡！</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T01:43:59.013438+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":195,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T01:01:44+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T06:37:11.834754+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T01:37:14.715382+00:00","content_hash":"9539a0fb1807927d25aab371420b85ef7ddc90b39b88c1086a8809018cf6e30e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-21T01:43:59.013438+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}